OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charges Donaghy was convicted of
OL,7,Frelate to an email she sent to the
OL,8,Fprivate email address of
OL,9,Fthen-Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,10,Fleader Arlene Foster.
